 "remarks": "Welcome to 11 Revonah Circle South. A beautiful and light-filled contemporary home, ideally situated on a quiet double cul-de-sac in one of Stamford's most desirable and convenient neighborhoods. Enjoy the best of both worlds-peaceful, private living just a short stroll from shops, restaurants, houses of worship, and all Stamford has to offer. Inside, abundant natural light, beautiful hardwood floors, and an inviting layout creates a warm and welcoming atmosphere. An impressive living room, features windows on three walls and a gas fireplace - perfect for gathering and entertaining. The living room flows seamlessly into the dining room and kitchen, creating an effortless connection between the home's main living spaces. A spacious and stunning family room features a custom fireplace with limestone-inspired finish to complete the main level. Upstairs, four large bedrooms have been thoughtfully designed with stylish finishes, offering a wonderful blend of comfort and sophistication. The expansive walk-out lower level provides exceptional flexibility, featuring a generous recreation and play area, a full bathroom, and three additional rooms currently used for guest accommodations, a home office, and a modern gym. Outside, the private backyard offers a wonderful setting for entertaining, relaxing, or enjoying outdoor play. With its exceptional flow for everyday living, stylish interiors, thoughtful updates, and unbeatable location, this special home truly has it all.",
